lestone pool. Worth submitting early and often (1 submission per day limit).</p>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Ragheb haddara", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/default-thumb.png", "url": "/l4r3nn", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 35670825, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "COMMENT", "votes": {"canUpvote": true}, "kernelVersion": 0, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"teamLeader": {"displayName": "Ragheb haddara", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/default-thumb.png", "url": "/l4r3nn", "userName": "l4r3nn", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 35670825, "profileUrl": "/l4r3nn", "performanceTier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "userId": 35670825, "progressionOptOut": false}, "intro": ""}}, {"id": 3504528, "postDate": "2026-07-28T09:17:29.637Z", "rawMarkdown": "Hey, so u have to open source the solution the same day as the deadline; for example 30 of september; or the day after", "content": "<p>Hey, so u have to open source the solution the same day as the deadline; for example 30 of september; or the day after</p>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Kostas Mouratidis", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/default-thumb.png", "url": "/kostasmouratidis", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 21364866, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "COMMENT", "votes": {"canUpvote": true}, "kernelVersion": 0, "competitionRanking": 1397, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"teamLeader": {"displayName": "Kostas Mouratidis", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/default-thumb.png", "url": "/kostasmouratidis", "userName": "kostasmouratidis", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 21364866, "profileUrl": "/kostasmouratidis", "performanceTier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "userId": 21364866, "progressionOptOut": false}, "intro": ""}}, {"id": 3485390, "postDate": "2026-07-01T11:56:22.910Z", "rawMarkdown": "Does the milestone prize depend on public positions? Or private positions?", "content": "<p>Does the milestone prize depend on public positions? Or private positions?</p>", "replies": [{"id": 3485452, "postDate": "2026-07-01T13:28:05.400Z", "rawMarkdown": "Public for both milestones ", "content": "<p>Public for both milestones </p>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "parthenos", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/15559822-kg.png?t=2026-08-13-14-46-51", "url": "/nihilisticneuralnet", "tier": "MASTER", "id": 15559822, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "COMMENT", "votes": {"totalVotes": 1, "canUpvote": true, "totalUpvotes": 1}, "kernelVersion": 0, "competitionRanking": 466, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"teamLeader": {"displayName": "parthenos", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/15559822-kg.png?t=2026-08-13-14-46-51", "url": "/nihilisticneuralnet", "userName": "nihilisticneuralnet", "tier": "MASTER", "id": 15559822, "profileUrl": "/nihilisticneuralnet", "performanceTier": "MASTER", "userId": 15559822, "progressionOptOut": false}, "intro": ""}}], "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Yiheng Wang", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/682501-kg.png", "url": "/yiheng", "tier": "GRANDMASTER", "id": 682501, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "COMMENT", "votes": {"canUpvote": true}, "kernelVersion": 0, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"teamLeader": {"displayName": "Yiheng Wang", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/682501-kg.png", "url": "/yiheng", "userName": "yiheng", "tier": "GRANDMASTER", "id": 682501, "profileUrl": "/yiheng", "performanceTier": "GRANDMASTER", "userId": 682501, "progressionOptOut": false}, "intro": ""}}], "commentSort": "COMMENT_LIST_SORT_BY_HOT", "firstMessage": {"id": 3480446, "postDate": "2026-06-24T20:36:05.363Z", "rawMarkdown": "Hi everyone, \nif you are considering open-sourcing your solution for the Milestone Prizes, please note that the deadline to do so is 11:59pm UTC on the corresponding day. For ARC-AGI-3, there are 2 milestone prizes, the first one is next week on June 30th, and the second one is on September 30th. I have updated the [Timeline](www.kaggle.com/competitions/arc-prize-2026-arc-agi-3/overview/timeline) and the [Prizes](www.kaggle.com/competitions/arc-prize-2026-arc-agi-3/overview/prizes) sections in the Overview tab to reflect this. \n\nGood luck!\n\nMar\u00eda", "content": "<p>Hi everyone, \nif you are considering open-sourcing your solution for the Milestone Prizes, please note that the deadline to do so is 11:59pm UTC on the corresponding day. For ARC-AGI-3, there are 2 milestone prizes, the first one is next week on June 30th, and the second one is on September 30th. I have updated the <a href=\"www.kaggle.com/competitions/arc-prize-2026-arc-agi-3/overview/timeline\" target=\"_blank\">Timeline</a> and the <a href=\"www.kaggle.com/competitions/arc-prize-2026-arc-agi-3/overview/prizes\" target=\"_blank\">Prizes</a> sections in the Overview tab to reflect this. </p>\n<p>Good luck!</p>\n<p>Mar\u00eda</p>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Mar\u00eda Cruz", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/19579895-kg.jpg?t=2025-01-23-22-51-30", "url": "/macruzbar", "tier": "STAFF", "id": 19579895, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "ADMIN", "votes": {"totalVotes": 6, "canUpvote": true, "totalUpvotes": 6}, "kernelVersion": 0, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"teamLeader": {"displayName": "Mar\u00eda Cruz", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/19579895-kg.jpg?t=2025-01-23-22-51-30", "url": "/macruzbar", "userName": "macruzbar", "tier": "STAFF", "id": 19579895, "profileUrl": "/macruzbar", "performanceTier": "STAFF", "userId": 19579895, "progressionOptOut": false}, "intro": ""}}, "firstMessageId": 3480446, "forumId": 10403401, "forumName": "ARC Prize 2026 - ARC-AGI-3", "id": 713634, "isStickied": true, "name": "Clarification on deadline for milestone prizes", "parentName": "arc-prize-2026-arc-agi-3", "parentUrl": "/competitions/arc-prize-2026-arc-agi-3", "postDate": "2026-06-24T20:36:05.362110200Z", "totalVotes": 6, "url": "/competitions/arc-prize-2026-arc-agi-3/discussion/713634", "totalMessages": 5, "authorPerformanceTier": "STAFF", "authorProgressionOptOut": false}}